# Signing and API credentials — never commit these.
# The App Store Connect key is issued once and cannot be re-downloaded; the
# certificate and provisioning profiles are account-bound. CI reads all of them
# from GitHub Actions secrets, so nothing here needs to be in the repo.
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
